'parameter test with subckt 
.subckt foo ( a b c )
v1 ( a b ) zzz
v2 ( b c ) xxx
.ends foo
x1 ( 1 0 3 )  foo  zzz=a xxx=b
x2 ( 2 0 4 )  foo  xxx=a zzz=83
.param a=13 b=923 c=a 
